  "problem": "Maya and Priya are café owners. In the previous season, $55%$ of Maya’s orders were takeout, while the decimal proportion of Priya’s orders that were takeout was $0.8.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Less than half of Maya's orders were takeout.\n\nII. More than half of Priya's orders were takeout.\n\nIII. Maya had a greater percentage of takeout orders compared to Priya.",
