  "html": "<div id=\"question-350261\" class=\"question\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                        <div class=\"questionNumber\">Question 5</div>\n\n                        \n                               \n                         \n        \n\n                        \n\n                        <div id=\"questionText-350261\" class=\"questionText\">\n                            <p></p><p>Maya and Priya are café owners. In the previous season, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"23\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of Maya’s orders were takeout, while the decimal proportion of Priya’s orders that were takeout was <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"24\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.8</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p><p></p>\n<p></p><p>Which of the following statements are true?</p><p></p>\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  Less than half of Maya's orders were takeout. </li><li>  More than half of Priya's orders were takeout. </li><li>  Maya had a greater percentage of takeout orders compared to Priya. </li></ol>                                     \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                            <table class=\"choicesTable\">\n                                <tbody><tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceALetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350261-choiceA\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"a\">a</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td class=\"choiceText\">I only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350261-choiceB\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"b\">b</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBText\" class=\"choiceText\">II and III only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350261-choiceC\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"c\">c</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCText\" class=\"choiceText\">II only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350261-choiceD\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"d\">d</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDText\" c